OL,3,GNEWSAMr Potato Head returns to town
OL,4,Aafter 'spud-batical'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe may have been away on a
OL,7,F"spud-batical", but a giant Mr Potato
OL,8,FHead statue has now returned to a
OL,9,Fmarket town in Derbyshire after repairs
OL,10,Fand a lick of paint.
OL,12,FThe 7ft (2.1m) spud was gifted in 2000
OL,13,Fby Belper's US twin town of Pawtucket,
OL,14,FRhode Island, the birthplace of the
OL,15,FHasbro toy.
OL,17,FJoshua Grimshaw, from Belper Town
OL,18,FCouncil, said it was "great to have him
OL,19,Fback" and admitted it was a shame he
OL,20,Fwas in hiding during the release of Toy
OL,21,FStory 5 in June.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
