OL,3,GNEWSAMr Potato Head returns to town
OL,4,Aafter 'spud-batical'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I wish we could have tied it all in
OL,7,Ftogether," he added. "The stars didn't
OL,8,Falign, unfortunately, so we were stuck
OL,9,Fwith the timing we had."
